This directory contains declarations that may be used by Mbed TLS.
These declarations are not part of the TF-PSA-Crypto API, and may
be changed or removed without notice.

Over the life time of TF-PSA-Crypto 1.x and Mbed TLS 4.x, we intend
to remove all dependencies of Mbed TLS on these unstable interfaces,
and corresponding minor releases of TF-PSA-Crypto will stop providing
these interfaces.
